{"parse": {"title": "Demon Academy Star", "pageid": 2874, "revid": 35295, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Demon Academy Stars</b> are limited capsules from <b>Update 12</b> that granted the player a <b>random mythic unit</b> from Update 12 and could be obtained by purchasing them from Issai for 650 Demon Academy Symbols.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Information\">Information</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span style=\"color:#FFC208;\">+Guaranteed to contain one of 3 Limited Demon Academy Mythic Units</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#921296;\"><i>\"I'm fine with being fool. If there's no way I can win with my abilities, then I'll stick with being a fool to the end!\"</i></span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtainable_Mythics\">Obtainable Mythics</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"container&#95;ChBox\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill,minmax(115px,1fr)); grid-auto-flow: row; justify-items: center; list-style-type: none; grid-row-gap: 13px; font-size: 18px;border-radius: 8px; background: #2e2e2e29; box-shadow: 0 0 11px -2px #c7000080, inset 0 0 20px 0px #c7000033; margin: 0; padding: 13px; overflow: hidden;\"><dd class=\"ChBox&#95;item Rarity(Unknown)\">\n<div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;contet&#95;container\"><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;background\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;&#95;item\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ria\" title=\"Ria\"><img alt=\"Riony\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/2/2b/Riony.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/101?cb=20250823152531\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"101\" height=\"101\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Riony.png\" data-image-key=\"Riony.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></div></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text\">Ria</div></dd>\n<dd class=\"Ch